      "key": "E4",
      "title": "Epic: Architecture evidence users can trust",
      "purpose": "Prevent scope leakage and ambiguous evidence from turning a completed scan into a misleading architecture conclusion; preserve deterministic, inspectable analysis.",
      "outcome": "Examples and alternate scenarios are identifiable, declared/extracted evidence stays distinguishable, changes retain provenance, and correction uses reviewed existing mechanisms.",
